    "slug": "tcvm-food-therapy",
    "title": "TCVM Food Therapy",
    "summary": "Hot dogs and cold dogs, cooling and warming proteins, and how preparation changes a food's energy — plus where it disagrees with the numbers.",
    "letter": "T",
